CHANGES IN VERSION 1.31.2
-------------------------
 o Converted the vignette from Sweave/PDF (qPLEXdata.Rnw) to R Markdown/HTML
   (qPLEXdata.Rmd) using BiocStyle, removing the LaTeX build dependency.
CHANGES IN VERSION 1.31.1
-------------------------
 o Fixed vignette build error: pass the contrast name (names(contrasts))
   rather than the named contrast vector to getContrastResults(), matching
   the current qPLEXanalyzer API.
